{"id":"5045","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5045_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>照片显示了正在发展的积雨云，估计云顶高度为7公里。云的上部是具有纤维结构的卷云状，可将其确定为鬃状云云种。在砧状云发展的早期阶段，顶部开始（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处）展开，这是砧状云附加特征。在远处可以看见的是另一个附加特征：降水性，可以看见在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处有阵雨落下。在此图像中也可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中积云</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Kairo Kiitsak","location":"爱沙尼亚Pärnu County, Papsaare","latitude":"纬度: 58° 23' 45'' N","longitude":"经度: 24° 25' 4'' E","date":"31 July 2015 1337 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.10.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.10.3"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5045_syn_cumulonimbus-capillatus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>表面图表显示，一个锢囚锋已经越过该区域，与中心位于芬兰南部的998 hPa中纬度气旋有关。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5045_sat_cumulonimbus-capillatus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在照片拍摄时拍摄的卫星图像显示了芬兰南部和波罗的海国家的一的云斑，那里有对流云并且有相关的阵雨落下。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Sat24.com/Eumetsat/英国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4752_main_cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus-praecipitatio_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>该图显示了积雨云上升云塔的大型垂直范围。顶部被傍晚的太阳照亮，左侧呈现明亮的白色，而云的其余部分则更暗。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">右上方的云是纤维状的</span>，表明是鬃状云云种，右侧有一个砧状切变 - 这是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状附加特征</span>。云的顶部（从这个角度看）<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">正在失去锐度</span>，因为这个细胞从浓积云转变为积雨云。在云层之下，太阳照亮了一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">强大的降水轴</span> - 降水性补充特征。几乎围绕强大对流云的深灰色云层是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云</span>，而左上方的白色纤维云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">毛卷云</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frann Brothers","location":"美国德克萨斯州得林瓜","latitude":"纬度: 29° 19' 18'' N","longitude":"经度: 103° 36' 58'' W","date":"21 August 2014 1800 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.10.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.10.3"}]}]}